1
00:00:10,960 --> 00:00:13,140
I'm Liu Haizhu.

2
00:00:14,560 --> 00:00:15,599
Nowadays, in Songliao,

3
00:00:16,120 --> 00:00:17,199
or even across the Northeast,

4
00:00:18,079 --> 00:00:19,460
plenty of folks know my name.

5
00:00:23,019 --> 00:00:23,640
But this...

6
00:00:24,579 --> 00:00:25,920
isn't just my story.

7
00:00:27,300 --> 00:00:28,420
It's a story of brothers,

8
00:00:29,199 --> 00:00:30,559
a story of hot blood,

9
00:00:31,600 --> 00:00:33,439
a story of love and loyalty,

10
00:00:33,979 --> 00:00:35,920
a story of booze and blades.

11
00:00:37,759 --> 00:00:38,520
Liu Haizhu!

12
00:00:38,880 --> 00:00:40,200
Choose!

13
00:00:40,679 --> 00:00:41,140
This...

14
00:00:41,899 --> 00:00:43,259
is a story that happened in the Northeast,

15
00:00:43,899 --> 00:00:45,380
in the city of Songliao.

16
00:00:54,939 --> 00:00:56,140
Back then, I was 17.

17
00:00:56,640 --> 00:00:57,820
I'd never left Songliao,

18
00:00:58,460 --> 00:00:59,780
never seen true evil,

19
00:01:00,140 --> 00:01:01,619
nor true kindness.

20
00:01:02,399 --> 00:01:03,079
And I never could've known

21
00:01:03,920 --> 00:01:05,620
that what I stumbled into that day

22
00:01:06,299 --> 00:01:07,260
would throw my entire life

23
00:01:07,980 --> 00:01:09,379
completely off course.

24
00:01:13,939 --> 00:01:16,060
Roll, roll, ball,

25
00:01:17,420 --> 00:01:19,200
Clash, clash, cymbals,

26
00:01:20,159 --> 00:01:22,799
Roll, roll, let's see who's gonna

27
00:01:25,040 --> 00:01:27,060
play with me.

28
00:01:46,159 --> 00:01:47,120
This one's good.

29
00:01:55,519 --> 00:01:56,540
N-No, don't!

30
00:01:57,739 --> 00:01:58,159
You can't!

31
00:01:59,439 --> 00:01:59,859
Please don't!

32
00:02:01,379 --> 00:02:02,620
Let me take a leak first.

33
00:02:04,579 --> 00:02:06,560
I'll show you a real good time when I get back.

34
00:02:07,200 --> 00:02:08,539
No, please, don't!

35
00:02:09,759 --> 00:02:10,259
Don't!

36
00:02:12,340 --> 00:02:13,139
Please!

37
00:02:32,840 --> 00:02:33,259
Boss,

38
00:02:33,939 --> 00:02:34,819
if this works out,

39
00:02:35,340 --> 00:02:36,460
we're gonna hit the big time!

40
00:02:38,740 --> 00:02:39,280
He,

41
00:02:39,379 --> 00:02:40,580
I did so much this time,

42
00:02:40,979 --> 00:02:42,280
can't you give me a bigger cut?

43
00:02:56,520 --> 00:02:57,180
Are you all right?

44
00:02:58,020 --> 00:02:58,860
Ziwen.

45
00:03:03,580 --> 00:03:04,060
Let's go.

46
00:03:16,000 --> 00:03:16,819
Shut your mouth.

47
00:03:20,580 --> 00:03:21,539
You want money?

48
00:03:22,919 --> 00:03:23,719
I'll burn it for you!

49
00:03:46,780 --> 00:03:47,259
Run!

50
00:03:51,199 --> 00:03:52,139
You think you can run?

51
00:03:56,000 --> 00:03:56,759
Ziwen!

52
00:03:57,159 --> 00:03:58,080
Ziwen!

53
00:03:58,159 --> 00:03:58,780
Get down!

54
00:04:00,139 --> 00:04:01,479
Help me!

55
00:04:04,460 --> 00:04:04,919
Get down!

56
00:04:05,620 --> 00:04:06,219
Get down here!

57
00:04:06,360 --> 00:04:07,099
Ziwen!

58
00:04:07,939 --> 00:04:08,840
Ziwen!

59
00:04:28,120 --> 00:04:28,720
Don't move.

60
00:04:37,879 --> 00:04:39,060
Have your balls even dropped yet?

61
00:04:40,100 --> 00:04:40,939
And you're playing with a gun?

62
00:04:42,040 --> 00:04:42,480
Shoot.

63
00:04:42,839 --> 00:04:43,920
Come on, shoot right here. Come on!

64
00:05:59,120 --> 00:06:01,079
You little bastards, just you two wait!

65
00:06:13,279 --> 00:06:13,759
Thanks.

66
00:06:16,199 --> 00:06:16,980
I'm Feng Ziwen.

67
00:06:19,060 --> 00:06:19,879
I'm Liu Haizhu.

68
00:06:21,100 --> 00:06:21,720
That day,

69
00:06:22,459 --> 00:06:24,439
a gunshot in the sun under the red flag

70
00:06:25,240 --> 00:06:27,000
shattered Songliao's old underworld.

71
00:06:27,420 --> 00:06:28,459
The former kingpin,

72
00:06:28,959 --> 00:06:31,060
the human trafficker Old He was wanted

73
00:06:31,360 --> 00:06:32,959
and vanished without a trace.

74
00:06:33,319 --> 00:06:34,139
Over the next few years,

75
00:06:34,680 --> 00:06:35,519
with the Reform and Opening-up,

76
00:06:35,939 --> 00:06:37,800
folks felt for stones to cross the river.

77
00:06:38,180 --> 00:06:39,740
The dual-track system gained full steam,

78
00:06:40,160 --> 00:06:41,060
while in the shadows,

79
00:06:41,800 --> 00:06:43,100
a new underworld order

80
00:06:43,600 --> 00:06:44,660
gradually took shape.

81
00:06:45,259 --> 00:06:46,420
For doing the right thing,

82
00:06:46,899 --> 00:06:47,720
I got a commendation,

83
00:06:48,060 --> 00:06:49,040
and later joined the army.

84
00:06:49,759 --> 00:06:51,600
After being discharged, I returned to Songliao

85
00:06:51,939 --> 00:06:52,920
to take over my father's job,

86
00:06:53,540 --> 00:06:54,680
working at the state-owned factory.

87
00:06:55,420 --> 00:06:56,459
Life was quiet and steady,

88
00:06:57,120 --> 00:06:58,720
yet a fire deep inside me

89
00:06:59,480 --> 00:07:00,660
refused to be snuffed out.

90
00:07:01,420 --> 00:07:02,779
Attention, attention.

91
00:07:02,959 --> 00:07:04,620
All workers, please note:

92
00:07:05,060 --> 00:07:06,339
It's freezing cold this year,

93
00:07:06,360 --> 00:07:08,040
so the factory is giving out extra benefits.

94
00:07:08,560 --> 00:07:11,620
All factory workers, go to the repair shop

95
00:07:11,879 --> 00:07:13,860
to collect your extra coal coupons.

96
00:07:14,079 --> 00:07:15,420
It's 50 jin short.

97
00:07:15,680 --> 00:07:16,360
This isn't right.

98
00:07:17,600 --> 00:07:18,120
Hold on, wait a minute.

99
00:07:18,160 --> 00:07:18,720
Wait a second, wait.

100
00:07:19,100 --> 00:07:22,019
We get 450 jin of benefit coal every year.

101
00:07:22,399 --> 00:07:23,240
Deputy Director Ma,

102
00:07:23,800 --> 00:07:26,360
how come the year you take over the factory,

103
00:07:26,519 --> 00:07:27,500
it drops to 400?

104
00:07:27,879 --> 00:07:28,579
Liu Haizhu, what's your problem?

105
00:07:28,579 --> 00:07:29,500
Got an issue with it?

106
00:07:29,519 --> 00:07:30,139
Yeah, I do!

107
00:07:30,839 --> 00:07:32,060
Workers run this place.

108
00:07:32,139 --> 00:07:33,040
Shorting us this much all at once,

109
00:07:33,040 --> 00:07:34,019
we can't even ask about it?

110
00:07:35,939 --> 00:07:36,319
Exactly!

111
00:07:36,319 --> 00:07:37,379
Why do you always cause trouble?

112
00:07:37,680 --> 00:07:38,860
Take it or get the hell out!

113
00:07:39,360 --> 00:07:39,899
Hey, what did you just say?

114
00:07:39,920 --> 00:07:40,939
What did you say? What are you doing?

115
00:07:41,459 --> 00:07:42,259
Who do you think you're talking to?

116
00:07:43,519 --> 00:07:44,720
If there's a problem, solve it.

117
00:07:45,040 --> 00:07:45,519
Right?

118
00:07:46,360 --> 00:07:46,860
Look,

119
00:07:47,060 --> 00:07:47,699
you can't just

120
00:07:48,540 --> 00:07:50,060
stir up trouble between us,

121
00:07:50,199 --> 00:07:50,660
can you?

122
00:07:53,439 --> 00:07:54,980
Officer Zhou Meng did the right thing.

123
00:07:55,279 --> 00:07:56,459
Just speak up if you have questions.

124
00:07:56,839 --> 00:07:57,420
Right?

125
00:07:58,540 --> 00:08:00,519
Because Officer Zhou Meng

126
00:08:01,379 --> 00:08:02,100
has high competence

127
00:08:03,220 --> 00:08:04,079
and high awareness.

128
00:08:04,680 --> 00:08:05,639
All of us

129
00:08:05,779 --> 00:08:07,779
should learn from her.

130
00:08:09,579 --> 00:08:11,139
That's settled for today's coal distribution.

131
00:08:11,279 --> 00:08:11,720
Dismissed.

132
00:08:11,939 --> 00:08:13,019
Xiao Zhou, come with me for a moment.

133
00:08:13,079 --> 00:08:14,019
Hold on, hold on, hold on.

134
00:08:14,019 --> 00:08:14,480
Don't settle it just like that.

135
00:08:14,660 --> 00:08:15,579
No, no, no.

136
00:08:16,620 --> 00:08:18,079
Wait, what's going on here?

137
00:08:18,579 --> 00:08:20,839
The old director went to study in Beijing,

138
00:08:20,879 --> 00:08:22,300
and the coal coupons are already short?

139
00:08:23,100 --> 00:08:25,439
Someone can't be skimming off the top

140
00:08:25,579 --> 00:08:27,439
and holding back our workers' coal, right?

141
00:08:27,740 --> 00:08:29,639
Is it because our maintenance and driving crews

142
00:08:29,639 --> 00:08:31,040
don't have any inside connections?

143
00:08:31,160 --> 00:08:32,620
You've got no damn conscience!

144
00:08:33,360 --> 00:08:34,059
Shameless!

145
00:08:35,139 --> 00:08:35,820
Liu Haizhu,

146
00:08:36,379 --> 00:08:38,120
you sure have strong support among the masses.

147
00:08:38,419 --> 00:08:40,419
Well, Director, you must protect our interests.

148
00:08:40,539 --> 00:08:41,379
If you don't protect workers' interests,

149
00:08:41,539 --> 00:08:42,740
aren't you just dead weight?

150
00:08:42,840 --> 00:08:43,980
Exactly! Haizhu's right!

151
00:08:44,100 --> 00:08:45,440
Right, Haizhu is right!

152
00:08:45,480 --> 00:08:46,000
Fine.

153
00:08:46,500 --> 00:08:47,580
So I'm just dead weight.

154
00:08:48,100 --> 00:08:49,379
Then from now on,

155
00:08:49,659 --> 00:08:51,299
if anything happens in this factory,

156
00:08:51,539 --> 00:08:52,860
you can all go to Liu Haizhu!

157
00:08:53,139 --> 00:08:53,720
Fellow workers!

158
00:08:53,820 --> 00:08:54,639
If I were the director,

159
00:08:54,899 --> 00:08:55,620
every bit of missing welfare coal,

160
00:08:55,659 --> 00:08:57,179
not an ounce or pound short,

161
00:08:57,179 --> 00:08:58,039
I'd distribute it all to you!

162
00:08:58,360 --> 00:08:59,460
Good! Great!

163
00:08:59,460 --> 00:09:01,000
Fine, it's a deal.

164
00:09:01,279 --> 00:09:02,860
If you can make up everyone's coal

165
00:09:02,940 --> 00:09:04,440
down to the very last pound,

166
00:09:05,059 --> 00:09:07,559
I'll start calling you Director Liu.

167
00:09:07,700 --> 00:09:08,100
Deal!

168
00:09:08,299 --> 00:09:09,299
Director Liu it is, then!

169
00:09:09,639 --> 00:09:12,399
Director Liu! Director Liu! Director Liu!

170
00:09:12,519 --> 00:09:15,200
Director Liu! Director Liu! Director Liu!

171
00:09:15,360 --> 00:09:18,120
Director Liu! Director Liu! Director Liu!

172
00:09:26,179 --> 00:09:27,419
Just let me know if you ever need anything.

173
00:09:27,799 --> 00:09:29,080
You gave me all of this.

174
00:09:29,279 --> 00:09:30,559
Do you have enough to keep warm?

175
00:09:30,879 --> 00:09:31,360
It's fine.

176
00:09:31,940 --> 00:09:33,200
The factory is handing out coal coupons today.

177
00:09:34,059 --> 00:09:34,620
All right then.

178
00:09:34,740 --> 00:09:35,620
I'll take it, then.

179
00:09:36,100 --> 00:09:36,799
Don't mention it.

180
00:09:37,080 --> 00:09:37,480
Thanks.

181
00:09:37,539 --> 00:09:38,139
Look at you.

182
00:09:38,320 --> 00:09:38,980
All right, all right.

183
00:09:39,039 --> 00:09:39,519
Watch your step.

184
00:09:41,059 --> 00:09:41,480
Look at that.

185
00:09:41,980 --> 00:09:43,159
Back just as we were talking about him.

186
00:09:43,200 --> 00:09:43,519
Yeah.

187
00:09:43,620 --> 00:09:44,080
Aunt Cai.

188
00:09:44,480 --> 00:09:45,840
Did the factory hand out the coal coupons?

189
00:09:48,279 --> 00:09:49,419
Don't just stand there.

190
00:09:49,419 --> 00:09:50,820
Hurry up and go fetch the coal.

191
00:09:51,179 --> 00:09:52,000
They'll be off work soon.

192
00:09:54,480 --> 00:09:54,899
Dad...

193
00:09:55,440 --> 00:09:57,000
Don't "Dad" me, just go!

194
00:10:06,779 --> 00:10:07,639
Eastern Tyrant.

195
00:10:08,500 --> 00:10:10,320
You really dared to show up alone, huh?

196
00:10:11,240 --> 00:10:12,259
You've got some serious nerve.

197
00:10:15,940 --> 00:10:17,480
We agreed to talk one-on-one.

198
00:10:18,500 --> 00:10:21,200
My word is ironclad.

199
00:10:22,019 --> 00:10:23,279
Don't give me that useless crap.

200
00:10:24,279 --> 00:10:25,240
Does keeping your word put food on the table,

201
00:10:25,279 --> 00:10:26,720
or can you take it to bed like a woman?

202
00:10:40,299 --> 00:10:41,519
Got it, Third Master.

203
00:10:43,620 --> 00:10:44,139
Third Master,

204
00:10:45,299 --> 00:10:46,019
don't bring up that ancient history

205
00:10:46,059 --> 00:10:47,620
and make a joke of yourself.

206
00:10:49,659 --> 00:10:50,320
Huoyazi,

207
00:10:51,659 --> 00:10:53,100
the old rules of the street...

208
00:10:53,820 --> 00:10:55,399
...you don't give a damn about them, huh?

209
00:11:01,039 --> 00:11:02,419
Which of us is breaking the rules?

210
00:11:04,320 --> 00:11:06,080
You think you're hot shit now, Eastern Tyrant.

211
00:11:07,539 --> 00:11:09,279
Done playing kingpin in the east,

212
00:11:09,679 --> 00:11:11,620
now you come north to steal my racket, huh?

213
00:11:12,039 --> 00:11:13,600
When I, Huoyazi, fought for the North End,

214
00:11:13,639 --> 00:11:15,019
you were still pissing in the mud!

215
00:11:22,320 --> 00:11:22,860
Third Master,

216
00:11:23,740 --> 00:11:24,720
why don't you get some rest?

217
00:11:32,220 --> 00:11:33,919
Eastern Tyrant, didn't you hear me talking to you?!

218
00:11:35,659 --> 00:11:36,519
Let me tell you something.

219
00:11:37,100 --> 00:11:38,840
Once Huoyazi sinks his teeth into meat,

220
00:11:38,899 --> 00:11:40,419
he never spits it back out!

221
00:11:42,759 --> 00:11:44,059
Feeling pretty cozy soaking in there, huh?

222
00:11:44,580 --> 00:11:46,200
Think I won't make you crawl out naked?

223
00:12:02,360 --> 00:12:03,720
I'll beat the hell out of you, you little punk!

224
00:12:03,960 --> 00:12:05,019
Giving me attitude when I call you out?

225
00:12:06,559 --> 00:12:07,679
I oughta punch your lights out!

226
00:12:08,240 --> 00:12:10,559
Wasn't I just speaking up for my coworkers?

227
00:12:10,759 --> 00:12:12,039
So now I'm in the wrong?

228
00:12:12,279 --> 00:12:13,840
You always have to show off, don't you?

229
00:12:14,980 --> 00:12:15,720
Always acting like a big shot!

230
00:12:15,919 --> 00:12:17,080
Pushing your luck every chance you get!

231
00:12:17,559 --> 00:12:18,799
Everyone else got docked 50 jin,

232
00:12:18,960 --> 00:12:20,759
and you gave up your coal to cover them!

233
00:12:20,879 --> 00:12:22,179
You're freezing your own dad

234
00:12:22,240 --> 00:12:23,399
just to keep other people warm!

235
00:12:24,259 --> 00:12:25,759
Is Liu Haizhu home?

236
00:12:26,960 --> 00:12:27,779
Liu Haizhu!

237
00:12:28,360 --> 00:12:28,960
It's for you.

238
00:12:29,799 --> 00:12:30,580
Alright, alright.

239
00:12:32,759 --> 00:12:33,700
I'm gonna smack you silly!

240
00:12:37,159 --> 00:12:37,899
Zhou Meng.

241
00:12:39,139 --> 00:12:40,080
What brings you here?

242
00:12:40,960 --> 00:12:42,580
What are you going to do about your coal?

243
00:12:43,940 --> 00:12:45,159
Don't worry about the coal.

244
00:12:45,240 --> 00:12:46,279
I'll figure something out.

245
00:12:46,440 --> 00:12:47,279
Like what?

246
00:12:47,740 --> 00:12:48,659
I'll go scavenge coal cinders!

247
00:12:53,840 --> 00:12:54,519
Um...

248
00:12:57,159 --> 00:12:58,399
I've saved up some money.

249
00:12:59,039 --> 00:13:00,960
Take it and buy some coal first.

250
00:13:01,320 --> 00:13:02,059
Just to tide you over.

251
00:13:02,220 --> 00:13:03,320
No, no, you really don't have to.

252
00:13:03,379 --> 00:13:04,500
How could I take your money?

253
00:13:04,980 --> 00:13:06,860
If anyone's paying, it should be Ma Limin!

254
00:13:07,379 --> 00:13:08,700
I have... I have my own ways.

255
00:13:08,840 --> 00:13:09,700
I'll sort it out tomorrow.

256
00:13:12,559 --> 00:13:13,500
Alright then.

257
00:13:14,340 --> 00:13:16,360
Let me know if you run out of options.

258
00:13:23,879 --> 00:13:25,240
Do... do you have something else to say?

259
00:13:25,559 --> 00:13:26,960
Why don't you come inside for a bit?

260
00:13:27,840 --> 00:13:28,539
No, that's fine.

261
00:13:30,240 --> 00:13:31,820
Tomorrow at two in the afternoon,

262
00:13:32,620 --> 00:13:34,299
The Cultural Palace has a poetry reading.

263
00:13:34,539 --> 00:13:35,779
Do you want to go together?

264
00:13:36,259 --> 00:13:37,279
A po... poetry gathering?

265
00:13:40,159 --> 00:13:40,860
Are you going?

266
00:13:41,899 --> 00:13:43,279
Of course! I'll definitely be there.

267
00:13:44,240 --> 00:13:44,759
Great.

268
00:13:45,659 --> 00:13:47,539
I'll wait for you there tomorrow, then.

269
00:13:47,779 --> 00:13:48,679
You don't have to wait for me.

270
00:13:48,740 --> 00:13:49,919
I'll go early and wait for you.

271
00:13:54,860 --> 00:13:56,519
It's a promise, then?

272
00:13:57,000 --> 00:13:57,879
It's a promise.

273
00:13:58,259 --> 00:13:58,860
I'm off.

274
00:14:25,360 --> 00:14:26,840
What's this? Got a girlfriend?

275
00:14:29,159 --> 00:14:30,220
Sh-she's a co- coworker.

276
00:14:31,200 --> 00:14:32,240
That girl is so pretty.

277
00:14:32,279 --> 00:14:33,500
Could she really fall for you?

278
00:14:34,919 --> 00:14:35,340
Come on, Dad.

279
00:14:35,419 --> 00:14:36,759
Where did you even see her?

280
00:14:38,240 --> 00:14:39,539
Can't I look out the window?

281
00:14:40,399 --> 00:14:41,720
Why are you so damn nosy?

282
00:14:43,139 --> 00:14:44,620
She gave you money for coal,

283
00:14:44,679 --> 00:14:46,240
so why act all high and mighty?

284
00:14:46,799 --> 00:14:47,980
Want your old man to freeze to death?

285
00:14:48,720 --> 00:14:50,179
Don't we still have some at home?

286
00:14:50,399 --> 00:14:51,720
If we ration it, we can hold out.

287
00:14:53,779 --> 00:14:54,179
Wait...

288
00:14:54,559 --> 00:14:55,120
Where's the coal?

289
00:14:56,759 --> 00:14:58,759
D-didn't Aunt Cai scoop it all up?

290
00:14:58,820 --> 00:14:59,899
Wait, all of it?

291
00:15:00,879 --> 00:15:01,299
Come on...

292
00:15:02,019 --> 00:15:02,879
This old man!

293
00:15:05,700 --> 00:15:06,820
She took that whole pile?

294
00:15:09,899 --> 00:15:11,559
The coal business in the north is mine now.

295
00:15:15,220 --> 00:15:15,980
If you don't speak up,

296
00:15:16,220 --> 00:15:17,220
I'll take that as your consent.

297
00:15:25,000 --> 00:15:25,679
Spread the word.

298
00:15:26,500 --> 00:15:27,360
Songliao's waters...

299
00:15:28,200 --> 00:15:29,720
It's time to clean them up.

300
00:15:34,399 --> 00:15:36,019
Were it not for me,

301
00:15:37,080 --> 00:15:38,419
who knows how many would claim the throne

302
00:15:39,059 --> 00:15:40,039
and call themselves kings.
